From 7f7badcf2429458e99748e74c074ee49dedb0e15 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alex Perrin <44126061+AlexPerrin@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 20:37:02 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] feat: Genie random event

Problem: there were no random events.

Change: new module content/events/random-events with the Genie, scheduled
by the OSRS Wiki's random event spawn mechanics. The next event is due 1-2
hours after the last one on a real-time clock kept in the persistent
attribute random_event_next_at, checked every 5 minutes of play; an event
that came due while offline moves 10-70 minutes forward. Due in a bank, the
Grand Exchange, the listed dungeons or an instance, or while transformed, it
is missed and re-rolled; an open interface or a Make-X repeat delays it; no
second event NPC while one is out. The Genie appears beside the player, calls
them every 12 seconds and follows them, leaves after a minute or when they
transform; Talk-to gives the lamp (dropped at their feet with a full
inventory), Dismiss sends him away, Rub gives 10 x the skill's level in XP.
Timers random_event (433) and random_event_genie (434); ::randomevent.

Tests: GenieRandomEventTest (10, integration).

Data sources: OSRS Wiki (CC BY-NC-SA 3.0): Random events (Spawn mechanics,
Locations without random events, Changes, Trivia), Genie, Transcript:Genie,
Lamp.
